<figure class="diagram">
    <div class="diagram-scroll">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 440 520" role="img" aria-labelledby="write-title write-desc">
            <title id="write-title">Life of a write</title>
            <desc id="write-desc">
                Planned write path. A put is appended to the write-ahead log and applied to the memtable.
                A flush writes an immutable segment. A commit publishes a manifest. Merges combine segments later.
            </desc>
            <rect width="440" height="520" fill="#ffffff" />
            <g font-family="Courier New, Courier, monospace" font-size="14" fill="#000000">
                <rect x="70" y="16" width="300" height="64" fill="#c0c0c0" stroke="#000080" stroke-width="2" />
                <text x="86" y="42">1. put or delete</text>
                <text x="86" y="64">WAL append, then memtable</text>

                <polygon points="220,88 210,108 230,108" fill="#000080" />

                <rect x="70" y="116" width="300" height="64" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#000080" stroke-width="2" />
                <text x="86" y="142">2. flush</text>
                <text x="86" y="164">memtable becomes a segment</text>

                <polygon points="220,188 210,208 230,208" fill="#000080" />

                <rect x="70" y="216" width="300" height="80" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#000080" stroke-width="2" />
                <text x="86" y="242">3. commit</text>
                <text x="86" y="264">data, then manifest, then</text>
                <text x="86" y="284">the inactive superblock</text>

                <polygon points="220,304 210,324 230,324" fill="#000080" />

                <rect x="70" y="332" width="300" height="64" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#000080" stroke-width="2" />
                <text x="86" y="358">4. merge, in the background</text>
                <text x="86" y="380">new segment, new manifest</text>

                <text x="16" y="430">A crash before the superblock write keeps the previous commit.</text>
                <text x="16" y="454">Deletions live in tombstone sidecars, outside the segment.</text>
                <text x="16" y="478">This path is specified (SPEC sections 4.5 and 8) and not built yet.</text>
                <text x="16" y="502">Milestones M2 and M6.</text>
            </g>
        </svg>
    </div>
    <figcaption>
        Planned local write path (SPEC §4.5, §8.2). Each box is a step; the words in the box are the step, not a color key.
    </figcaption>
</figure>
